---
title: Plugin Demo
start: start
---

# A small game using three example plugins (see docs/plugins.md):
# weather (a lasting effect), memory (a minigame the story waits on) and
# meter (an element for screens). The memory plugin also has a function,
# used in an expression below.

define mira "Mira"

image cliff = "bg/cliff_road_dusk.svg"
image shore = "bg/shore_dawn.svg"
image mira = "sprites/mira_smile.svg"

var trust = 3
var turns = 0

screen hud:
  text "Trust" at 3% 3%
  @meter bar value=trust max=10 label="Trust" at 3% 8% size 20% 2%

label start:
  scene cliff with fade
  show screen hud
  @weather start kind="petals" amount=60
  show mira
  mira: The petals are early this year.
  mira: Want to play a game while we wait for the ferry?
  @memory play pairs=4 -> turns
  if turns <= @memory.perfect(4) + 2:  # close to a perfect round
    set trust += 3
    mira: {turns} turns! You've got a good memory.
  else:
    set trust += 1
    mira: {turns} turns. Not bad.
  @weather start kind="rain" amount=200
  mira: And there's the rain.
  @weather stop
  scene shore with dissolve
  mira: Clear skies again.
  hide screen hud
  "The end."
